{"root":{"data":{"id":"dijynrftevs0","created":1778920420889,"text":"X线成像原理"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dilp3ymcsvk0","created":1779096599163,"text":"X线成像原理"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dilr1ax8n4w0","created":1779102033070,"text":"影像的形成","note":"1. 摄影\n2. 影像\n3. 信息\n4. 成像过程:X线-->信息-->检测-->图像形成.\n5. 成像系统\n6. X线影像信息的形成:X线-->被照体-->屏片系统\\影像增强管的输入屏-->转换为可见光-->胶片-->显影定影-->X线照片"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dilr1d1tcp40","created":1779102037700,"text":"信息的传递","note":"* X线(信息载体)-->被检者(信息源)-->增感屏(信息接收器)\n* 五个阶段\n\t1. X线穿过被照体后携带了信息\n    2. 带有信息的X线摄入增感屏后产生的可见光照射胶片形成潜影(中心环节)\n    3. 观片灯\n    4. 视网膜\n    5. 医生诊断"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dilr1gp7j6o0","created":1779102045645,"text":"X线照片影像的要素","note":"* 物理因素:\n\t1. 密度\n\t* 基础要素\n    \t1. 对比度\n        2. 锐利度\n        3. 颗粒度\n* 几何因素\n\t1. 失真度"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dilsdotn3cg0","created":1779105824807,"text":"X线照片的密度","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dilsdyjygeo0","created":1779105845989,"text":"透光率"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dilsdvjvjmo0","created":1779105839454,"text":"阻光率"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dilsby8khh40","created":1779105688572,"text":"光学密度"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dilse6bj1js0","created":1779105862894,"text":"影响因素"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dilsjizrbz40","created":1779106282301,"text":"照射量"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dilsjo39uzk0","created":1779106293397,"text":"管电压","note":"n次方正比\n"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dilsjqsymcg0","created":1779106299304,"text":"摄影距离","note":"平方反比\n"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dilsjt2jgog0","created":1779106304237,"text":"增感屏胶片系统"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dilsjxe3qqo0","created":1779106313643,"text":"被照体厚度及密度"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dilsk1z6pjc0","created":1779106323625,"text":"照片冲洗因素"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dilsd59o1ew0","created":1779105782240,"text":"对比度","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dilsc0t8wfs0","created":1779105694176,"text":"肢体对比度"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dimblv5dx480","created":1779160066579,"text":"X线对比度"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dimbmo0un4w0","created":1779160129432,"text":"X线吸收系数"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dimbmq7jnc80","created":1779160134190,"text":"物体厚度"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dimbmuen85k0","created":1779160143326,"text":"物体密度"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dimbmrk1qvc0","created":1779160137123,"text":"原子序数"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dimbmxbdtr40","created":1779160149660,"text":"X线波长"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dimblxy3p680","created":1779160072669,"text":"胶片对比度"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dilsc7c18nk0","created":1779105708373,"text":"X线照片的光学对比度","note":"X线照片上相邻组织的影像的密度差\n依存于X线对比度和胶片对比度的放大结果"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dimbt9dhmi80","created":1779160646093,"text":"影响因素"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dimbtrbyqk00","created":1779160685183,"text":"胶片","note":"胶片的反差系数越大照片对比度越大"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dimbtsnstnk0","created":1779160688076,"text":"X线的质","note":"能量的三次方成***反比***\n*光电效应和电压色三次方成反比*"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dimbty09xh40","created":1779160699714,"text":"X线的量","note":"没直接影像但量增加可使密度增加使对比度好转"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dimbu1nzrc80","created":1779160707678,"text":"灰雾","note":"本底灰雾\n散射线所致"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dimbu5j5mvk0","created":1779160716093,"text":"被照体","note":"* 原子序数\n\t* 被照体对X线的吸收主要是光电吸收,光电吸收与原子序数的4次方成正比.\n* 密度\n\t* 密度越大吸收的X线越多\n* 厚度\n\t* 密度和原子序数相同时,厚度越薄吸收越少."},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dilscf3m4kg0","created":1779105725278,"text":"X线照片的锐利度","note":"* 锐利度:照片上相邻组织的影像界限是否清楚明了的程度(过渡是否光滑).\n\t* 锐利度:S=K/H.\n    * K:两组织之间的密度差.\n    * H:两组织之间的移行距离.\n* 模糊度:锐利度的反义词,两个组织影像密度之间的过渡幅度,长度(mm)量度表示,及密度移行距离H,也称不锐利度."},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dimjk5lr7tk0","created":1779182501488,"text":"影响因素","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dimjka64sxk0","created":1779182511427,"text":"几何学模糊"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dimjkcku1e00","created":1779182516669,"text":"移动模糊","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dimjr5dq4340","created":1779183049551,"text":"生理性"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dimjr6lbwps0","created":1779183052188,"text":"意外性"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dimjkfw4arc0","created":1779182523882,"text":"增感屏影像","note":"* 荧光体的光扩散\n* X线斜射效应\n* 增感屏与胶片的密着程度","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dimk13e57yo0","created":1779183828865,"text":" 照片影像的总模糊度"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dilscoge8940","created":1779105745642,"text":"X线照片的颗粒度"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dimks271ru80","created":1779185942091,"text":"影响因素"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dimks4lspb40","created":1779185947337,"text":"X线量子斑点(噪声)"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"diml1zq9u740","created":1779186720365,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dimks7w9klk0","created":1779185954500,"text":"胶片卤化银颗粒的尺寸和分布"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dimkse2rhpk0","created":1779185967954,"text":"胶片对比度"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dimksgo8yi80","created":1779185973606,"text":"增感屏荧光体的尺寸和分布"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dimkstf3lr40","created":1779186001351,"text":"颗粒度的测量"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dilscuiqdvc0","created":1779105758844,"text":"失真度"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dilr1wnp3340","created":1779102080382,"text":"感光效应与自动曝光控制"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dilr27duhtc0","created":1779102103731,"text":"焦点,被照体,探测器之间的关系"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dilr2p2q9kw0","created":1779102142241,"text":"散射线"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dilp48qyhb40","created":1779096621209,"text":"数字X线成像原理"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dilr2y0z35k0","created":1779102161726,"text":"CR"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dilr2yvlqmo0","created":1779102163578,"text":"DR"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dilr3b8rr880","created":1779102190495,"text":"数字合成体层摄影"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dilp4c60v8g0","created":1779096628650,"text":"乳腺摄影成像原理"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dilr57nd27k0","created":1779102339399,"text":"模拟"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dilr59lntbs0","created":1779102343649,"text":"数字"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dilp4lf0elc0","created":1779096648785,"text":"DSA成像原理"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dilr5ioxj7k0","created":1779102363438,"text":"基本原理"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dilr5keqe5c0","created":1779102367175,"text":"信号采集"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dilr5ucv9w00","created":1779102388830,"text":"成像方式"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dilr5xfvjdk0","created":1779102395542,"text":"剪影方式"},"children":[]}]}]},"template":"default","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}